    <briefdescription>
<para>Power detection block with buffer capture and replay. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Detects signal power on the first input channel. When power exceeds threshold, captures signal to buffer. During silence, replays captured signal. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
